        "readme": "<h1>AMD Game Stream</h1> <p>Headless game streaming on an AMD GPU: Xorg + amdgpu + DRI3, Sunshine (VA-API), Steam, RetroArch, Lutris, Heroic and noVNC.</p> <p>Image source: https://github.com/csaki89/amd-game-stream</p> <p>The container uses the host network (needed for Sunshine/Moonlight discovery). <code>/dev/dri</code> is passed through the Devices section, never as a bind mount.</p>",
